nk-code-datas : Nat → Code → Lst Word → Lst Word
nk-code-datas zero c acc = acc
nk-code-datas (suc k) (cdata d ps) acc = nk-fold-codes (nk-code-datas k) ps (nk-add-word d acc)
nk-code-datas (suc k) (ccon d j fs ds) acc = nk-fold-codes (nk-code-datas k) (l-app fs ds) (nk-add-word d acc)
nk-code-datas (suc k) (celim d P B x) acc = nk-fold-codes (nk-code-datas k) (lcons P (lcons x B)) (nk-add-word d acc)
nk-code-datas (suc k) (ccase d B x) acc = nk-fold-codes (nk-code-datas k) (lcons x B) (nk-add-word d acc)
nk-code-datas (suc k) c acc = nk-fold-codes (nk-code-datas k) (code-kids c) acc
